---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy – Solar Path">
  <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-16 text-slate-300">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-yellow-400 mb-6">
      Privacy Policy – Solar Path
    </h1>

    <p class="mb-4"><strong>Developer:</strong> Peter Bleakley</p>

    <p class="mb-4">
      Solar Path does not collect, store, or share any personal data.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6 mb-2">Use of Location Data</h2>
    <p class="mb-4">
      Solar Path uses Apple’s CoreLocation framework to determine your device’s
      GPS location in real time. This location is used solely to calculate solar
      positions. No location data is stored or transmitted off your device.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6 mb-2">Third-Party Services</h2>
    <p class="mb-4">
      This app does not use third-party SDKs, analytics services, or advertising frameworks.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6 mb-2">Children’s Privacy</h2>
    <p class="mb-4">
      This app is not intended for use by children under the age of 13.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6 mb-2">Contact</h2>
    <p class="mb-4">
      If you have any questions about this privacy policy, please contact:
      <a class="text-yellow-400 hover:underline" href="mailto:support@navapps.org">
        support@navapps.org
      </a>
    </p>

    <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mt-8">
      Effective date: 19 June 2025
    </p>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>